    {
      "text": "can ye not discern the signs of the times, Matt. 16:3. what shall be the sign of thy coming, Matt. 24:3 (Mark 13:4; Luke 21:7; D&C 45:16; JS—M 1:4). false prophets, and shall shew great signs and wonders, Matt. 24:24 (Mark 13:22; D&C 45:40; JS—M 1:22). then shall appear the sign of the Son of man in heaven, Matt. 24:30 (Luke 21:25; D&C 45:39; JS—M 1:36). what shall be the sign when all these things shall be, Mark 13:4. these signs shall follow them that believe, Mark 16:17 (Morm. 9:24; Ether 4:18; D&C 58:64; 84:65). this shall be a sign unto you; Ye shall find the babe wrapped in swaddling clothes, Luke 2:12. many other signs truly did Jesus, John 20:30. I will shew … signs in the earth, Acts 2:19. many wonders and signs were done by the apostles, Acts 2:43 (5:12). sign of circumcision, Rom. 4:11. tongues are for a sign, 1 Cor. 14:22. signs of an apostle were wrought among you, 2 Cor. 12:12. Satan with all power and signs, 2 Thes. 2:9. God also bearing them witness, both with signs and wonders, Heb. 2:4.",
